{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":2,"title":"중복 제거 후 정렬","desc":"<p>중복을 없애고 <b>오름차순으로 정렬</b>한 벡터를 돌려주는 <code>unique_sorted(x)</code>를 만드세요. (결과가 2개 이상인 경우만 다뤄요)</p>","solution":"unique_sorted <- function(x) {\n  sort(unique(x))\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>unique()</code>와 <code>sort()</code>를 함께 써요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"unique_sorted(c(3, 1, 3, 2, 1))","expected":[1,2,3],"visible":true},{"call":"unique_sorted(c(\"b\", \"a\", \"b\"))","expected":["a","b"],"visible":true},{"call":"unique_sorted(c(2, 1))","expected":[1,2],"visible":false},{"call":"unique_sorted(numeric(0))","expected":[],"visible":false}],"starter":"unique_sorted <- function(x) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-325"}